---
title: "Team Leadership Assignment (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: receive team_id, member_id
    q_validate --> q_check_team: validate team_id is string
    q_check_team --> q_check_member: team exists
    q_check_team --> q_error_team: team not found
    q_check_member --> q_check_membership: member exists
    q_check_member --> q_error_member: member not found
    q_check_membership --> q_assign_leader: member belongs to team
    q_check_membership --> q_error_not_member: member not in team
    q_assign_leader --> q_final: create TeamLeader(team_id, member_id)
    q_final --> [*]: return TeamLeader
    q_error_team --> [*]: revert error
    q_error_member --> [*]: revert error
    q_error_not_member --> [*]: revert error

    note right of q_assign_leader
        INV-001: team_id must reference valid Team.id
        INV-002: member_id must reference valid Member.supabase_auth_user_id
        INV-003: leader must have MemberTeamRelation for the same team
        INV-004: each team has at most one leader
    end note
